      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one thing i'm worried about is data breaches. like, if someone were to sneak into my system or if there's some kind of \"hidden\" vulnerability that we don't see, what exactly are we supposed to do? what are our legal responsibilities if we realize some data has been taken without us knowing immediately?",
